    "implementation_delta": "Publish CanonicalByteCidVectors@1 as compact recipes that generate exact DAG-JSON bytes and CIDv1 identities for the fourteen PCPR-040 shared contracts. Pins detect remint. Catalog identity baguqeeraqpptps2gf55wmthv3sm5nzlxqqdjfyg2ggkbl5ovfzuvvvsxap4a is reused and not reminted. Key-order and NFC caf\u00e9 invariants share one CID. Datasets and Kit bind the fourteen vector CIDs and refuse remint without sibling import or re-encoding. This is not a freeze, not negative or cross-language vectors, and not cross-repository compatibility checks. Live supervisor and CUDA re-qualification stay typed unavailable. This evaluator never writes DuckDB or Quack state and never emits a closed PCPR release outcome."
  },
